If each flight carries an average of $180$ passengers, what is the maximum total passenger departure capacity per day from Melbourne?

On a one-way circular train loop, travel times between successive stations are:
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\usetikzlibrary{decorations.markings}
\tikzset{midarrow/.style={decoration={markings, mark=at position 0.6 with {\arrow{>}}}, postaction={decorate}}}
\coordinate (C) at (0.5,0.8);
\coordinate (M) at (3.0,0.8);
\coordinate (SJ) at (5.0,2.0);
\coordinate (CQ) at (3.0,3.2);
\coordinate (W) at (0.5,3.2);
\draw[midarrow] (C) -- (M) node[pos=0.3, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$3$};
\draw[midarrow] (M) -- (SJ) node[pos=0.3, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$2$};
\draw[midarrow] (SJ) -- (CQ) node[pos=0.3, fill=white, inner sep=1pt] {$3$};
